{"page":53,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:23","surah":3,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَ إِلَى ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوا۟ نَصِيبًا مِّنَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ يُدْعَوْنَ إِلَىٰ كِتَـٰبِ ٱللَّهِ لِيَحْكُمَ بَيْنَهُمْ ثُمَّ يَتَوَلَّىٰ فَرِيقٌ مِّنْهُمْ وَهُم مُّعْرِضُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Have you considered those who were given a share of the Scripture? When they are asked to accept judgement from God’s Scripture, some of them turn their backs and walk away, all because they declare,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Have not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَ","en_gloss":"you seen","transliteration":"tara","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"[to]","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُوتُوا۟","en_gloss":"were given","transliteration":"ūtū","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَصِيبًۭا","en_gloss":"a portion","transliteration":"naṣīban","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"the Scripture","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُدْعَوْنَ","en_gloss":"They are invited","transliteration":"yud'ʿawna","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(the) Book","transliteration":"kitābi","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِيَحْكُمَ","en_gloss":"that (it should) arbitrate","transliteration":"liyaḥkuma","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمْ","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"3:23"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَتَوَلَّىٰ","en_gloss":"turns away","transliteration":"yatawa